        "id": "NhOohhymoVNs"
      },
      "source": [
        "# Lab Assignment: English-to-German Machine Translation with a Transformer\n",
        "\n",
        "**Objective:**\n",
        "The goal of this assignment is to fine-tune a pre-trained **Transformer** model for machine translation. You will load a dataset, fine-tune the model, and evaluate it using the BLEU score.\n",
        "\n",
        "You will also compare your new model's performance and architecture against a previous **LSTM-based** model, and visualize the **self-attention** and **cross-attention** mechanisms that make the Transformer so powerful.\n"
      ],
      "id": "NhOohhymoVNs"
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {
        "id": "Fam13aZyoVN1"
      },
      "source": [
        "## Part 1: Setup and Environment\n",
        "\n",
        "First, install all the necessary libraries."
      ],
      "id": "Fam13aZyoVN1"
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "execution_count": null,
      "metadata": {
        "id": "3k4D06hAoVN3"
      },
      "outputs": [],
      "source": [],
      "id": "3k4D06hAoVN3"
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {
        "id": "5Hx2Z2DmoVN5"
      },
      "source": [
        "## Part 2: Data Loading and Pre-processing\n",
        "\n",
        "### 1. Load the Dataset\n",
        "We have to use previously provided dataset, which contains parallel sentences for English-to-German translation."
      ],
      "id": "5Hx2Z2DmoVN5"
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "execution_count": null,
      "metadata": {
        "id": "psehe5hAoVN6"
      },
      "outputs": [],
