      "metadata": {
        "id": "-gqa4nDYoVN-"
      },
      "source": [
        "### 4. Apply Pre-processing\n",
        "Use the `.map()` function to apply this tokenization to the entire dataset."
      ],
      "id": "-gqa4nDYoVN-"
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
